"body": "This incident has been resolved. We experienced a network outage in our ORD data center caused by dropped packets between nodes, which led to failed health checks and a cluster-wide disruption. The outage was mitigated on July 14, and we've since applied network configuration changes across all our data centers to address the underlying cause and prevent recurrence. We apologize for the disruption it caused.",
